# NOTE: .git is deliberately NOT excluded.
#
# tools/provision refuses to run without it ("No Zulip Git repository present!"),
# which is why upstream's docker-zulip clones inside the image instead of copying
# a tree in. Dockerfile.preview removes it again once provision has finished, so
# the history costs build context but not image size.
.venv
node_modules
var/log
var/coverage
*.pyc
__pycache__
